  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2772\">\n<li data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2502\">\n<p data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2502\"><strong data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2413\">Positive</strong>: Indicates detection of one or more respiratory pathogens. Helps guide targeted therapy.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2602\">\n<p data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2602\"><strong data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2517\">Negative</strong>: No detectable viral or bacterial nucleic acid in the sample at the time of testing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2663\">\n<p data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2663\">Co-infections (e.g. RSV + Influenza) can also be detected.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2772\">\n<p data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2772\">Useful in evaluating <strong data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2722\">fever with respiratory symptoms</strong>, especially in immunocompromised or ICU patients.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
